# One line ending in the repo, whatever the checkout: Prettier expects LF, the Android SQLite plugin
# splits migrations on ";\n", and Dockerfile line continuations break with CRLF in Linux containers.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.jks binary
*.wasm binary
